  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Metabolization</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/ea/Bo_Dennis_2.gif/revision/latest?cb=20160817233951\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Bo Dennis 2\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/ea/Bo_Dennis_2.gif/revision/latest?cb=20160817233951\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/ea/Bo_Dennis_2.gif/revision/latest?cb=20160817233951 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/ea/Bo_Dennis_2.gif/revision/latest?cb=20160817233951 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Bo Dennis 2\" width=\"245\" height=\"125\" data-image-key=\"Bo_Dennis_2.gif\" data-image-name=\"Bo Dennis 2.gif\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Bo Dennis (Lost Girl) has to feed off sexual energy to satisfy her hunger.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Feed off anything/everything.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>feed off anything/everything</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Trait:Affinity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trait:Affinity\">Affinity</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Variations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Variations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMetabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Consumption</li>\n<li>Feeding</li>\n<li>Ingestion</li>\n<li>The Need to Feed</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMetabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Users can sustain themselves/their powers by feeding off of anything/everything, from matter, energy,&#160;emotions, substance, etc., taking them into their body as a source for their powers and/or conditions.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMetabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Accelerated_Assimilation\" title=\"Accelerated Assimilation\">Accelerated Assimilation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Perpetual_Nourishment\" title=\"Perpetual Nourishment\">Perpetual Nourishment</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Restoration\" title=\"Self-Restoration\">Self-Restoration</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Sustenance\" title=\"Self-Sustenance\">Self-Sustenance</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variations\">Variations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMetabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Atomic_Consumption\" title=\"Atomic Consumption\">Atomic Consumption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Benevorous\" title=\"Benevorous\">Benevorous</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Hunger\" title=\"Cosmic Hunger\">Cosmic Hunger</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Deity_Consumption\" title=\"Deity Consumption\">Deity Consumption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Emotion_Metabolization\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Emotion Metabolization\">Emotion Metabolization</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Metabolization\" title=\"Energy Metabolization\">Energy Metabolization</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fantastic-Matter_Metabolization\" title=\"Fantastic-Matter Metabolization\">Fantastic-Matter Metabolization</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ghost_Consumption\" title=\"Ghost Consumption\">Ghost Consumption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Inorganic_Consumption\" title=\"Inorganic Consumption\">Inorganic Consumption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Metabolization\" title=\"Elemental Metabolization\">Elemental Metabolization</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Air_Consumption\" title=\"Air Consumption\">Air Consumption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Darkness_Consumption\" title=\"Darkness Consumption\">Darkness Consumption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electricity_Consumption\" title=\"Electricity Consumption\">Electricity Consumption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Consumption\" title=\"Fire Consumption\">Fire Consumption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Light_Consumption\" title=\"Light Consumption\">Light Consumption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Soil_Consumption\" title=\"Soil Consumption\">Soil Consumption</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Pollution_Consumption\" title=\"Pollution Consumption\">Pollution Consumption</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Metabolization\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Magical Metabolization\">Magical Metabolization</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Malevorous\" title=\"Malevorous\">Malevorous</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Matter_Ingestion\" title=\"Matter Ingestion\">Matter Ingestion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Object_Consumption\" title=\"Object Consumption\">Object Consumption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Organic_Consumption\" title=\"Organic Consumption\">Organic Consumption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bodily_Fluid_Absorption\" title=\"Bodily Fluid Absorption\">Bodily Fluid Consumption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Blood_Consumption\" title=\"Blood Consumption\">Blood Consumption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Milk_Consumption\" title=\"Milk Consumption\">Milk Consumption</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bone_Consumption\" title=\"Bone Consumption\">Bone Consumption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Consumption\" title=\"Poison Consumption\">Poison Consumption</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Reality_Consumption\" title=\"Reality Consumption\">Reality Consumption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Solar_Consumption\" title=\"Solar Consumption\">Solar Consumption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Metabolization\" title=\"Soul Metabolization\">Soul Metabolization</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Spatial_Devouring\" title=\"Spatial Devouring\">Spatial Devouring</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Tantric_Metabolization\" title=\"Tantric Metabolization\">Tantric Metabolization</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Temporal_Devouring\" title=\"Temporal Devouring\">Temporal Devouring</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMetabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Affinity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Affinity\">Affinity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Vampiric_Draining\" title=\"Vampiric Draining\">Vampiric Draining</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMetabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May become addictive.</li>\n<li>Useless against <a href=\"/wiki/Immortality/Absolute\" title=\"Immortality/Absolute\">Absolute Immortality</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Flawless_Indestructibility\" title=\"Flawless Indestructibility\">Flawless Indestructibility</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Omnilock\" title=\"Omnilock\">Omnilock</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMetabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2><p>\nSee Also: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/VampiricDraining\">Vampiric Draining</a></p><div class=\"scrollable\" style=\"overflow:auto; max-height:275px; width:100%; -moz-border-radius-topleft:0.5em; border:1px solid #AAAAAA; padding-left:0.5em; background:transparent;\">\n<ul><li>Slayer Magic Wielders (<i>Fairy Tail</i>); via Dragon Slayer, God Slayer, Devil Slayer\n<ul><li>Dragon Slayers (<i>Fairy Tail</i>)</li></ul></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.outskirtspress.com/theyoungguardians/\">Patrick Donovan</a> (<i>The Young Guardians</i>); via heat metabolization</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dragonball.fandom.com/wiki/Yakon\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dragonball:Yakon\">Yakon</a> (<i>Dragon Ball Z</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/c:dhttp://dccomicsextendeduniverse.wikia.com/wiki/Doomsday\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dhttp://dccomicsextendeduniverse.wikia.com/wiki/Doomsday\">Doomsday</a> (<i>Batman vs Superman</i>)</li>\n<li>Harvesters (<i>The Deaths of Ian Stone</i>)</li>\n<li>Succubus (<i>Lost Girl</i>)\n<ul><li>Bo</li>\n<li>Aife</li></ul></li>\n<li>Incubi&#160;(<i>Folklore/Demonology/Mythology</i>)</li>\n<li>Succubi (<i>Folklore/Demonology/Mythology</i>)\n<ul><li>Lilith (<i>Abrahamic Religions</i>)</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/c:monstergirlencyclopedia:Monster_Girls\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:monstergirlencyclopedia:Monster Girls\">Monster Girls</a> (<i>Monster Girl Encyclopedia</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-682\">SCP-682 - Hard-To-Destroy Reptile</a> (<i>SCP Foundation</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/uiu-file-2014-014\">UIU File 2014-014</a> (<i>SCP Foundation</i>)</li>\n<li>Succubi (<i>Valkyrie Crusade</i>)</li>\n<li>Sex Gas (<i>Torchwood</i>)</li>\n<li>Neuro Nōgami (<i>Neuro: Supernatural Detective</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://monster-eater.fandom.com/wiki/Rude\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:monster-eater:Rude\">Rude</a> (<i>Monster Eater</i>)</li></ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMetabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"3c4673822098b7e9758b2d68ea533b8c\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:197px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:148px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"DeathsOfIanStone3-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:127px; width:195px; top:9.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:DeathsOfIanStone3.jpg\" title=\"DeathsOfIanStone3.jpg (21 KB)\" style=\"height:127px; width:195px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/2b/DeathsOfIanStone3.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/195?cb=20151213081646\" title=\"DeathsOfIanStone3.jpg (21 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Ian Stone (The Deaths of Ian Stone) unlike most Harvesters who feed from fear or pain, can feed from love instead making him more powerful than most.\" height=\"146\" width=\"195